  "description": "Create a payment recipient for payment initiation.  The recipient must be in Europe, within a country that is a member of the Single Euro Payment Area (SEPA).  For a standing order (recurring) payment, the recipient must be in the UK.\n\nThe endpoint is idempotent: if a developer has already made a request with the same payment details, Plaid will return the same `recipient_id`.\n",
